> concatenates them into the system prompt (per pi docs:
> "What the model is told → AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md / SYSTEM.md").
> Edit the canonical managed block in
> `~/.mpm/agent_installation/MPM_AGENT_INTEGRATION_SNIPPETS.md`,
> not this file, for behavioral changes.
